  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       ABOUT SECTION
  ============================================================ -->
  <section id="about" class="section" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">

        <div class="about-text reveal">
          <p class="section-label">Who I am</p>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="about-heading">
            Crafting software that <span class="gradient-text">matters</span>
          </h2>
          <div class="section-divider"></div>
          <p>
            Hi, I'm Malinga — a Software Engineering undergraduate with a deep
            passion for mobile application development. I love turning complex
            problems into clean, practical solutions that people actually want to use.
          </p>
          <p>
            My focus is Android development using Java and modern Android architecture
            components. I'm also interested in UI/UX design principles, ensuring that
            every app I build not only works well but feels great to use.
          </p>
          <p>
            When I'm not writing code, I'm exploring new tech stacks, contributing to
            academic projects, and working towards building apps that create real-world
            impact.
          </p>

          <div class="about-details">
            <div class="detail-item">
              <span class="detail-label">Location</span>
              <span class="detail-value">Sri Lanka 🇱🇰</span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-item">
              <span class="detail-label">Degree</span>
              <span class="detail-value">BSc. Software Engineering</span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-item">
              <span class="detail-label">Focus</span>
              <span class="detail-value">Android &amp; Mobile Dev</span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-item">
              <span class="detail-label">GitHub</span>
              <span class="detail-value">@DuminduMalinga</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-cards reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="info-card glass-card">
            <div class="info-card-icon">
              <i data-feather="smartphone" width="20" height="20"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="info-card-title">Android Development</p>
              <p class="info-card-desc">Building native Android apps with Java, leveraging Room, Firebase, and Material Design to deliver polished, production-ready experiences.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="info-card glass-card">
            <div class="info-card-icon" style="background:rgba(168,85,247,0.12);color:var(--accent-purple);">
              <i data-feather="layers" width="20" height="20"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="info-card-title">Software Engineering</p>
              <p class="info-card-desc">Applying OOP principles, design patterns, and software engineering best practices to build maintainable, scalable systems.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="info-card glass-card">
            <div class="info-card-icon" style="background:rgba(59,130,246,0.12);color:var(--accent-blue);">
              <i data-feather="pen-tool" width="20" height="20"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="info-card-title">UI/UX Design</p>
              <p class="info-card-desc">Creating intuitive interfaces that balance visual appeal with usability, ensuring every interaction feels purposeful and smooth.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SKILLS SECTION
  ============================================================ -->
  <section id="skills" class="section" aria-labelledby="skills-heading">
    <div class="container">
